# 3MF is a ZIP container and every other entry here is compressed or encoded.
# Line-ending normalisation would corrupt them, and diffing them is meaningless.
# Git's own binary detection would probably catch these, but "probably" is not a
# good property for the only copy of a part that has been fitted and works.
*.3mf   binary
*.3MF   binary
*.stl   binary
*.step  binary
*.png   binary
*.jpg   binary
*.jpeg  binary
